  "description": "现代化伤害系统：把原版战斗重做成「伤害乘区」体系 —— 26 种攻击/防御附魔、4 系药水、可配置战利品、MDS 合成台与 HUD 状态提示，并移除跳劈必暴击。\n\nModern Damage System rebuilds combat around a damage-multiplier system: 26 attack/defense enchantments, 4 potion lines, configurable loot, a dedicated MDS crafting station and an on-screen HUD.\n\n必选前置 / Requires：Fabric API、Better Combat、AttributeFix、MaxHealth Fix、Cloth Config API、Configured、MDS API。\n\n⚠️ 许可证 / License：自定义源代码公开协议（Custom Source-available License, All Rights Reserved）—— 禁止未经书面授权移植、修改、分发至网易中国版我的世界。",
